# Build context for antithesis/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this file in place
# of the root .dockerignore): only the engine build's inputs, without local
# build output. tools/dst/sync-context.py (run by npm run test:dst) adds each
# input Cargo records that this list drops.
*
!engine
engine/target
engine/dst/target
!tools/foundation/item-catalog.py
!tools/foundation/port-npc-animations.txt
!web/*.json
!references/isaac/rebirth/resources
!antithesis
